@startuml
!include style.puml
show members
skinparam ClassFontColor #000000
skinparam ClassBorderColor #000000
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFAA
title After list
object "live:AddressBook" as Live {
    records = ab1
}
object "LogicManager.undoHistory" as History {
    oldest to newest = ab0
}
Live -[hidden]right-> History
note bottom of History
Only predecessor snapshots are retained (maximum 100).
Undo consumes the newest snapshot; no redo state is retained.
History changes only after a successful save of changed records.
end note
@enduml
